+```
+App Name: Crypto Funding Rate Monitor
+
+Description:
+Crypto Funding Rate Monitor is a Mini App that tracks funding rates on cryptocurrency derivatives exchanges in real time. Monitor long and short funding rates, detect anomalies, and receive alerts for unusually high or low rates. Stay informed to optimize trading strategies and manage risks effectively.
+
+Key Features:
+ • Real-time tracking of funding rates for multiple exchanges
+ • Alerts for abnormal funding rate spikes or drops
+ • Historical funding rate charts and trend analysis
+ • Monitoring across multiple tokens and derivatives markets
+ • Dashboard for managing watchlists and rate alerts
+
+Use Case:
+Perfect for derivatives traders who want to anticipate funding costs, hedge positions, and optimize leveraged trading strategies.
+```
